    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“relevant proceedings” means proceedings brought in or in connection with the exercise of any function by the body as the Independent Supervisor"

-- src:17511 | (1) If the Independent Supervisor is an unincorporated association, any relevant proceedings may be brought by or against it in the name of any body corporate whose constitution provides for the establishment of the body.
@ref s 1237(1) Proceedings in the name of a body corporate (src:17511)
