`s 1237(3) the revoking order may make the provision with respect to pending proceedings` MEANS
    IF `an appointment under section 1228 is revoked` AND `the revoking order makes such provision as the Secretary of State thinks fit with respect to pending proceedings`
    THEN JUST TRUE
